    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This section provides guidance about the tender stage of the procurement process and the necessary documentation.",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Timescales for each procedure differ and are outlined in their respective stations.",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Quickfire Guide",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Issuing Documents Criteria",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Issuing Documents Criteria"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Access to the tender Procurement Documents must be:",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Issuing Documents Criteria"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "On the internet;",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Issuing Documents Criteria"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Unrestricted;",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Issuing Documents Criteria"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "With full direct access;",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Issuing Documents Criteria"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Free of charge.",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Issuing Documents Criteria"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": ". These documents must be accessible from the date of publication of a Contract Notice.",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Issuing Documents Criteria"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "For the Restricted Procedure only suppliers who have passed the procedure selection stage will be allowed to tender.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Issuing Documents Criteria"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "As with all aspects of the Procurement Journey, the activities at this stage must be carried out in a carefully managed manner that supports the Principles of Procurement .",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Issuing Documents Criteria"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "It is your responsibility to ensure the above requirements are met.",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Issuing Documents Criteria"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Guidance on conduct is therefore contained within the subsequent Issue Documents stations.",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Issuing Documents Criteria"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Consideration must also be given to Planning , Sustainable Procurement and Risk Management throughout the following stages of the Journey.",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Issuing Documents Criteria"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    }
  ],
